      "title": "Present simple",
      "rule": "Present Simple — har doim, odatda boʻladigan ish-harakat: *I work in Usmat.* — Men Usmatda ishlayman. *He/she/it* bilan feʼlga *-s* qoʻshiladi: *She works. He likes tea.* Baʼzi feʼllarga *-es* qoʻshiladi: *goes, watches, does*. Inkor: *I don't work*, *he doesn't work* — inkorda feʼl *-s*siz keladi! Savol: *Do you work? — Yes, I do.* *Does she work? — No, she doesn't.* *Every day, usually, always* soʻzlari bilan keladi.",
      "examples": [
        "I live in Usmat.",
        "Dilnoza works at a school.",
        "Bekzod goes to school every day.",
        "We don't like cold tea.",
        "He doesn't play football.",
        "Do you speak English? Yes, I do."
      ],
